{"id":"c8f3a8371faa8691","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-autonomous-closure.md","title":"自主可达序数闭包 Aut(α)","display":"df-autonomous-closure — 自主可达序数闭包 Aut(α)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-autonomous-closure","aliases":["18-df-autonomous-closure"],"display":"df-autonomous-closure — 自主可达序数闭包 Aut(α)","depends_on":["[[18-df-infinitary-derivability]]","[[18-df-infinitary-semantics]]","[[18-df-infinitary-operations]]","[[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definitions 8.3.1–8.3.2; TI notation from §6.7","source_pages":"135–136;100","source_pdf_pages":"145–146;110","verification_status":"source-definition-and-local-coding-checked","source_correspondence":"countable-ordinal closure; numerical templates and explicit TI code reconstruct the source abbreviations"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-autonomous-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-autonomous-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-autonomous-closure — 自主可达序数闭包 Aut(α)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02bcc9140b83afbe\" href=\"?note=02bcc9140b83afbe\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-derivability\">18-df-infinitary-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fab9ed41cc227c08\" href=\"?note=fab9ed41cc227c08\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-semantics\">18-df-infinitary-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"392bd14777be34cd\" href=\"?note=392bd14777be34cd\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-operations\">18-df-infinitary-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e5ab7fce1b232e4\" href=\"?note=5e5ab7fce1b232e4\" title=\"18-df-church-kleene-ordinal\">18-df-church-kleene-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definitions 8.3.1–8.3.2; TI notation from §6.7"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"135–136;100"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"145–146;110"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-local-coding-checked"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"countable-ordinal closure; numerical templates and explicit TI code reconstruct the source abbreviations"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> 的数变量模板、代入、对偶和秩见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"392bd14777be34cd\" href=\"?note=392bd14777be34cd\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-operations\">18-df-infinitary-operations</a>；标准解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fab9ed41cc227c08\" href=\"?note=fab9ed41cc227c08\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-semantics\">18-df-infinitary-semantics</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\xi\">\\(D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\xi\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"02bcc9140b83afbe\" href=\"?note=02bcc9140b83afbe\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-derivability\">18-df-infinitary-derivability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=x_0,v=x_1\">\\(u=x_0,v=x_1\\)</span> 是不同数变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0\">\\(X_0\\)</span> 是固定集变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_0\">\\(\\eta_0\\)</span> 为全零数赋值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_0(X)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Phi_0(X)=\\varnothing\\)</span> 为全空集赋值。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{field}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{field}(R)\\)</span> 和良基关系的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\\)</span> 精确复用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5e5ab7fce1b232e4\" href=\"?note=5e5ab7fce1b232e4\" title=\"18-df-church-kleene-ordinal\">18-df-church-kleene-ordinal</a>；这里不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 原始递归。次序关系采用该书的严格传递关系口径，序型仍为一般良基关系秩，不要求线性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)\\)</span> 是下式给出的闭数变量、含一个自由集参数的具体公式代码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta^*\">\\(\\beta^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 都由 Assertion 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)\\)</span> 中取值。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\mathrm{OrdTemp},P_H,\\mathrm{Prog}_H,E_H\">\\(\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\mathrm{OrdTemp},P_H,\\mathrm{Prog}_H,E_H\\)</span> 是下式引入的模板集、谓词及公式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\">\\(\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\\)</span> 为已引用 operations 的序数秩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle X,\\varnothing\\rangle\\mid X\\in\\mathcal X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle X,\\varnothing\\rangle\\mid X\\in\\mathcal X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\coloneqq\n\\{H\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(H)\\subseteq\\{u,v\\}\\land\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_1(H)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\coloneqq\n\\{H\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(H)\\subseteq\\{u,v\\}\\land\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_1(H)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{mn}\\coloneqq(H[u:=\\overline m]_\\infty)[v:=\\overline n]_\\infty\n\\qquad(H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\ m,n&lt;\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{mn}\\coloneqq(H[u:=\\overline m]_\\infty)[v:=\\overline n]_\\infty\n\\qquad(H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\ m,n&lt;\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_H\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(H_{mn},\\eta_0,\\Phi_0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_H\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(H_{mn},\\eta_0,\\Phi_0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdTemp}(H)\\leftrightarrow\nH\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R_H)\\land\n\\forall l,m,n&lt;\\omega\\\n\\bigl(\\langle l,m\\rangle\\in R_H\\land\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in R_H\n\\to\\langle l,n\\rangle\\in R_H\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrdTemp}(H)\\leftrightarrow\nH\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R_H)\\land\n\\forall l,m,n&lt;\\omega\\\n\\bigl(\\langle l,m\\rangle\\in R_H\\land\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in R_H\n\\to\\langle l,n\\rangle\\in R_H\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP_H(n,X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty H_{mn},\\mathsf a(\\overline m\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid m&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prog}_H(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty P_H(n,X),\\mathsf a(\\overline n\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\nE_H(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle H_{nm},H_{mn}\\rangle)\\mid m&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_2\\bigl(\\langle\\sim_\\infty\\mathrm{Prog}_H(X),\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty E_H(n),\\mathsf a(\\overline n\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\bigr)\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\qquad(H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\ X\\in\\mathcal X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP_H(n,X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty H_{mn},\\mathsf a(\\overline m\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid m&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prog}_H(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty P_H(n,X),\\mathsf a(\\overline n\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\nE_H(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle H_{nm},H_{mn}\\rangle)\\mid m&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_2\\bigl(\\langle\\sim_\\infty\\mathrm{Prog}_H(X),\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty E_H(n),\\mathsf a(\\overline n\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\bigr)\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\qquad(H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\ X\\in\\mathcal X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta^*\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\lambda&lt;\\omega_1\\mid\\beta&lt;\\lambda\\land0&lt;\\lambda\\land\n\\forall\\zeta&lt;\\lambda\\ (\\zeta+1&lt;\\lambda)\\}\\qquad(\\beta&lt;\\omega_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta^*\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\lambda&lt;\\omega_1\\mid\\beta&lt;\\lambda\\land0&lt;\\lambda\\land\n\\forall\\zeta&lt;\\lambda\\ (\\zeta+1&lt;\\lambda)\\}\\qquad(\\beta&lt;\\omega_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nB\\subseteq\\omega_1\\land\\alpha\\in B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in B\\ (\\beta^*\\subseteq B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in B\\ \\forall H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrdTemp}(H)\\land\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(H)&lt;\\lambda\\land\n\\exists\\xi,\\rho&lt;\\lambda\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^{\\xi}(\\{\\mathrm{TI}_H(X_0)\\})\n\\to\\operatorname{otyp}(R_H)\\in B\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nB\\subseteq\\omega_1\\land\\alpha\\in B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in B\\ (\\beta^*\\subseteq B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in B\\ \\forall H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrdTemp}(H)\\land\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(H)&lt;\\lambda\\land\n\\exists\\xi,\\rho&lt;\\lambda\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^{\\xi}(\\{\\mathrm{TI}_H(X_0)\\})\n\\to\\operatorname{otyp}(R_H)\\in B\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)\\mid\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)\\mid\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项展开 Definition 8.3.2 的三条生成条件：加入起始序数；允许有限后继步及其以下序数；仅在已获 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 之下同时有关系定义秩、证明高度、切秩三种界时接受新关系的序型。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}\\)</span> 与旧节点 051 的强临界历史别名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}\\)</span> 不同，也不等于节点 054 对任意给定理论族取的上确界。</p>\n<p>原书的“关系可由公式定义”和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(\\prec,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}(\\prec,X)\\)</span> 是缩写；本节点用二数变量模板、闭数项代入及实际逻辑构造将它们展开。模板无自由集变量，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_H\">\\(R_H\\)</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_0\">\\(\\Phi_0\\)</span>；两个数变量都被闭项替换，故不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_0\">\\(\\eta_0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_H(n)\">\\(E_H(n)\\)</span> 精确表示关系的 field；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_H(n,X)\">\\(P_H(n,X)\\)</span> 表示所有前驱在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>；于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)\\)</span> 就是进展性蕴含 field 包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。它属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\\)</span>，全部自由集参数至多为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>显式 WF 条件只保证部分函数 otyp 的调用合法；若存在所要求的推导，可靠性已蕴含对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的归纳，因此该条件冗余。对可数传递关系，关系秩仍可数，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 本身满足闭包条件；候选族非空。闭包条件对任意非空交保持，故所定义集合确是三条规则的最小闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta^*\">\\(\\beta^*\\)</span> 的候选非空，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta+\\omega\">\\(\\beta+\\omega\\)</span> 是严格在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 以上的可数极限序数；最小性给出唯一值。此处没有用待定义的“predicative”谓词或未定义的可定义性预言机。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-infinitary-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"02bcc9140b83afbe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-infinitary-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"fab9ed41cc227c08","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-infinitary-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-operations","status":"resolved","id":"392bd14777be34cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-infinitary-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-church-kleene-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5e5ab7fce1b232e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-operations","status":"resolved","id":"392bd14777be34cd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha<\\omega_1$。$\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 的数变量模板、代入、对偶和秩见 [[18-df-infinitary-operations]]；标准解释见 [[18-df-infinitary-semantics]]；$D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\xi$ 见 [[18-df-infinitary-derivability]]。$u=x_0,v=x_1$ 是不同数变量，$X_0$ 是固定集变量，$\\eta_0$ 为全零数赋值，$\\Phi_0(X)=\\varnothing$ 为全空集赋值。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"fab9ed41cc227c08","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha<\\omega_1$。$\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 的数变量模板、代入、对偶和秩见 [[18-df-infinitary-operations]]；标准解释见 [[18-df-infinitary-semantics]]；$D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\xi$ 见 [[18-df-infinitary-derivability]]。$u=x_0,v=x_1$ 是不同数变量，$X_0$ 是固定集变量，$\\eta_0$ 为全零数赋值，$\\Phi_0(X)=\\varnothing$ 为全空集赋值。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"02bcc9140b83afbe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha<\\omega_1$。$\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 的数变量模板、代入、对偶和秩见 [[18-df-infinitary-operations]]；标准解释见 [[18-df-infinitary-semantics]]；$D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\xi$ 见 [[18-df-infinitary-derivability]]。$u=x_0,v=x_1$ 是不同数变量，$X_0$ 是固定集变量，$\\eta_0$ 为全零数赋值，$\\Phi_0(X)=\\varnothing$ 为全空集赋值。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-church-kleene-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5e5ab7fce1b232e4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}(R)$、$\\operatorname{field}(R)$ 和良基关系的 $\\operatorname{otyp}(R)$ 精确复用 [[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]；这里不要求 $R$ 原始递归。次序关系采用该书的严格传递关系口径，序型仍为一般良基关系秩，不要求线性。$\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)$ 是下式给出的闭数变量、含一个自由集参数的具体公式代码。$\\beta^*$、$\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)$ 和 $\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)$ 都由 Assertion 定义；$B$ 在 $\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)$ 中取值。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha<\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"u=x_0,v=x_1","display":false},{"tex":"X_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_0(X)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{field}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otyp}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\mathrm{OrdTemp},P_H,\\mathrm{Prog}_H,E_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle X,\\varnothing\\rangle\\mid X\\in\\mathcal X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\coloneqq\n\\{H\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(H)\\subseteq\\{u,v\\}\\land\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_1(H)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"H_{mn}\\coloneqq(H[u:=\\overline m]_\\infty)[v:=\\overline n]_\\infty\n\\qquad(H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\ m,n<\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"R_H\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(H_{mn},\\eta_0,\\Phi_0)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdTemp}(H)\\leftrightarrow\nH\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R_H)\\land\n\\forall l,m,n<\\omega\\\n\\bigl(\\langle l,m\\rangle\\in R_H\\land\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in R_H\n\\to\\langle l,n\\rangle\\in R_H\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP_H(n,X)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty H_{mn},\\mathsf a(\\overline m\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid m<\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prog}_H(X)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty P_H(n,X),\\mathsf a(\\overline n\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid n<\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\nE_H(n)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle H_{nm},H_{mn}\\rangle)\\mid m<\\omega\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_2\\bigl(\\langle\\sim_\\infty\\mathrm{Prog}_H(X),\n\\mathsf C_\\omega\\bigl(\\langle\n\\mathsf D_2(\\langle\\sim_\\infty E_H(n),\\mathsf a(\\overline n\\in X)\\rangle)\n\\mid n<\\omega\\rangle\\bigr)\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\qquad(H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v},\\ X\\in\\mathcal X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta^*\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\lambda<\\omega_1\\mid\\beta<\\lambda\\land0<\\lambda\\land\n\\forall\\zeta<\\lambda\\ (\\zeta+1<\\lambda)\\}\\qquad(\\beta<\\omega_1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nB\\subseteq\\omega_1\\land\\alpha\\in B\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\beta\\in B\\ (\\beta^*\\subseteq B)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in B\\ \\forall H\\in\\mathrm{RelTemp}_{u,v}\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrdTemp}(H)\\land\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(H)<\\lambda\\land\n\\exists\\xi,\\rho<\\lambda\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^{\\xi}(\\{\\mathrm{TI}_H(X_0)\\})\n\\to\\operatorname{otyp}(R_H)\\in B\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)\\mid\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aut}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(\\prec,X)","display":false},{"tex":"R_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_0","display":false},{"tex":"E_H(n)","display":false},{"tex":"P_H(n,X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta+\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":5644,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-autonomous-closure]]"},{"id":"1def9217c695e458","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"旧名含 Predicative，现明确它只表示所声明集合 $\\mathcal T$ 中的阈值分类。本册已有 [[18-df-autonomous-closure]] 及 [[18-thm-autonomous-gamma0]]；这些具体接口不把本节点的任意理论族阈值分类变成无参数的预测性判据。"},{"id":"4f7cc9abc6e6630d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"旧稿以无定义 Predicative(T) 取上确界，并暗示 Γ₀，却没有理论族或判据。这里修为带显式集合参数的局部定义，不宣称任意被叫作“predicative”的理论族都以 Γ₀ 为界。原书 §8.3 明言 predicativity 有争议，随后具体定义自主闭包；§8.5.31 的 Γ₀ 结论针对该具体过程。原书的具体自主过程现见 [[18-df-autonomous-closure]]，其精确界见 [[18-thm-autonomous-gamma0]]；该过程与这里任意给定理论族的上确界具有不同输入。确定一个无参数 PredBound 尚需另给理论族，本节点自身仍不能作为 Γ₀ 上下界的证明依据。"},{"id":"4b4b62cab0a0c1b1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)$ 采用 [[18-df-autonomous-closure]] 的具体可数分支语言、关系模板、带切秩推导和最小闭包；$\\Gamma_0$ 采用 [[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]] 的首个强临界序数。等式把序数视为其全部严格前驱构成的 von Neumann 集合。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-autonomous-closure]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-autonomous-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["02bcc9140b83afbe","fab9ed41cc227c08","392bd14777be34cd","5e5ab7fce1b232e4"]}